<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5077"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Devbost<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Devbost<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, January 27, 2005 - 2:05 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text--><b><i>Landwehr looked gaunt - harried, does he call the shot? Or is he just carrying out someone else&#39;s orders?</i></b> <BR> <BR>I think any of us would look gaunt, too, if we had his job. <BR> <BR>Think what you do is stressful? Magnify it by a hundred. He&#39;s trying to identify someone who has killed at least eight people and who has eluded exposure for 31 years now. <BR> <BR>I, for one, can&#39;t even imagine what it must be like to be in his shoes.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
