<!--Post: 5224--><!--Time: 1106955119-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5224"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Jackal<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Jackal<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, January 28, 2005 - 3:31 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->And - forgive me for saying so - but has hundreds of thousands of people like me and you giving him our opinions of what is happening and what he should do about it.  I, for one, being the father of a police officer, do not envy what Landwehr has to face from the media and the public.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
