<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6332"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Audreyamw<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Audreyamw<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 06, 2005 - 7:07 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Photos of the Post Toasties Communication #8: <BR><a href="http://ghostiesannex.myphotoalbum.com/view_photo.php?set_albumName=BTK&amp;id=cereal27pp" target=_top>http://ghostiesannex.myphotoalbum.com/view_photo.p hp?set_albumName=BTK&amp;id=cereal27pp</a> <BR> <BR>You can flip forward through the photos to see more shots of the cereal box.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
